_0001053 \"A memory B cell that lacks expression of surface IgD.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0721601464\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0001066 \"A progenitor cell committed to the erythroid lineage. This cell is ter119-positive but lacks expression of other hematopoietic lineage markers (lin-negative).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:rhs\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20123131\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002107 \"An IgD-negative CD38-positive IgG memory B cell is a CD38-positive IgG-positive that has class switched and lacks expression of IgD on the cell surface with the phenotype IgD-negative, CD38-positive, and IgG-positive.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002471 \"Gr1-low non-classical monocyte that lacks expression of a MHC-II complex.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MP:0002407\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0002489 \"A thymocyte that lacks expression of CD4 and CD8.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22726837\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25843402\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25926446\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27194328\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37336974\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0020010 \"A GABAergic projection neuron located in the external segment of the globus pallidus (GPe) and defined by its exclusive projection to the dorsal striatum rather than to the subthalamic nucleus or basal ganglia output nuclei. In rodents and primates, it is characterized molecularly by expression of FOXP2, MEIS2, and NPAS1, and lacks expression of canonical pallidal markers NKX2-1 and LHX6 (Dodson et al., 2015; Abdi et al., 2015; Courtney et al., 2023). This neuron is GABAergic (GAD1/2⁺, SLC32A1/VGAT⁺) and typically PV⁻, forming the transcriptionally and developmentally LGE-derived subclass of GPe neurons (Dodson et al., 2015; Mallet et al., 2012).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:21918187\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30755708\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33150420\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4033065 \"A mature B cell that serves as an intermediate stage in the differentiation of naive B cells into a plasmablast. A preplasmablast expresses CD30 and IL-6R and lacks expression of CD20, CD23, CD38 and CD138.\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
